{"id":"f10cb4e88874efad","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-transverse.md","title":"Transversality","display":"df-transverse — Transversality","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-transverse","aliases":["58-df-transverse","Transversality"],"display":"df-transverse — Transversality","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]]","[[./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-transverse"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-transverse</span><span>Transversality</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-transverse — Transversality"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"432be048cd519891\" href=\"?note=432be048cd519891\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md\">../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cd9981d8428c2629\" href=\"?note=cd9981d8428c2629\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"becb68cbe0f3a15e\" href=\"?note=becb68cbe0f3a15e\" title=\"./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md\">58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,N,S,f,x,L\\in V\">\\(M,N,S,f,x,L\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq N\">\\(S\\subseteq N\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"432be048cd519891\" href=\"?note=432be048cd519891\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md\">../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"cd9981d8428c2629\" href=\"?note=cd9981d8428c2629\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md\">../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"becb68cbe0f3a15e\" href=\"?note=becb68cbe0f3a15e\" title=\"./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md\">58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d87c5d842ade903d\" href=\"?note=d87c5d842ade903d\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md\">../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Transverse}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\operatorname{Transverse}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transverse} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{Transverse}_S(f,S,M,N) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S(S,N,k)\\land\n\\forall x\\in f^{-1}[S]\\;\\exists T_M,T_N,T_S,L_f,L_\\iota,\\iota_S\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_M,M,x)\\land\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_N,N,f(x))\\land\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_S,S,f(x))\\land\n\\iota_S=\\{\\langle s,s\\rangle:s\\in S\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S(L_f,f,x,M,N)\\land\n\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S(L_\\iota,\\iota_S,f(x),S,N)\\land\nT_N=\\Bigl\\{u\\in T_N:\\exists v\\in L_f[T_M]\\;\\exists w\\in L_\\iota[T_S]\\;\n\\forall h\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(h,N,\\mathbb R)\\to u(h)=v(h)+w(h)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}transverse} \\vdash\n\\operatorname{Transverse}_S(f,S,M,N) \\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(f,M,N)\\land\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S(S,N,k)\\land\n\\forall x\\in f^{-1}[S]\\;\\exists T_M,T_N,T_S,L_f,L_\\iota,\\iota_S\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_M,M,x)\\land\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_N,N,f(x))\\land\n\\mathrm{TangentSpace}_S(T_S,S,f(x))\\land\n\\iota_S=\\{\\langle s,s\\rangle:s\\in S\\}\\land\n\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S(L_f,f,x,M,N)\\land\n\\mathrm{DifferentialBetween}_S(L_\\iota,\\iota_S,f(x),S,N)\\land\nT_N=\\Bigl\\{u\\in T_N:\\exists v\\in L_f[T_M]\\;\\exists w\\in L_\\iota[T_S]\\;\n\\forall h\\in V\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{SmoothMap}_S(h,N,\\mathbb R)\\to u(h)=v(h)+w(h)\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Transversality: tangent spaces span; generic position of maps relative to submanifolds</li>\n<li>The tangent space of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> is first pushed into <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T_{f(x)}N\">\\(T_{f(x)}N\\)</span> by the differential of the inclusion; tangent vectors belonging to different function spaces are no longer added directly.</li>\n<li>Jet transversality: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j^k f \\pitchfork S\">\\(j^k f \\pitchfork S\\)</span> implies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> can be perturbed to be transverse</li>\n<li>Preimage theorem: transverse preimage is submanifold; dimension formula</li>\n<li>Homotopy stability: transverse properties preserved under small homotopies</li>\n<li>Applications: intersection theory, Morse theory, moduli spaces</li>\n<li>The transverse-preimage and residual-genericity claims are downstream theorems, not defining clauses.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hirsch, Differential Topology</li>\n<li>Guillemin and Pollack, Differential Topology</li>\n<li>Milnor, Morse Theory (Appendix)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"432be048cd519891","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"cd9981d8428c2629","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tangent-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md","status":"resolved","id":"becb68cbe0f3a15e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[./58-df-differential-between-manifolds.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"d87c5d842ade903d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-smooth-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"432be048cd519891","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{EmbeddedSubmanifold}_S\\subseteq V^3$ (see [[../batch04/58-df-submanifold.md]]).","embed":false},{